  "description": "300 years ago, Saintess Maria was murdered for her magical powers, while her loyal knight, Avelron, was powerless to save her. But now, Maria has been reborn as a bright and happy young woman named Yeriel Hyem. Unaware of her true identity as a saintess, Yeriel is living a peaceful life with her beloved parents and younger brother. Things only seem to be looking up when she meets an enigmatic – and extremely handsome – man named Levnaor. But with his arrival comes mysterious events that Yeriel never expected… As things begin to unfold, can Yeriel continue to live her blissful life? Or will her tragic past come back to haunt her once-bright future? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
